abstract: >-
  Discrete-event digital twin (AnyLogic) of an automotive switch-panel assembly
  line developed at the NEMO Innovation Camp 2026 (Disruptive Scenario 2).
  Parallel flashing and a shared operator pool reduce the simulated time between
  finished units from about 24 s to 13.3 s. OASYS proposes a human-centric
  Industry 5.0 extension (Human Digital Twin, adaptive workforce, AI guidance).
keywords:
  - digital twin
  - discrete-event simulation
  - AnyLogic
  - BPMN
  - Industry 5.0
  - manufacturing
